===Etymology===
{{etymon|de|id=railway|af|de>Eisen>iron|de>Bahn>lane|tree=1}}
From {{af|de|Eisen|Bahn|gloss1=iron|gloss2=transport, lane}}, originally for the iron rails of trains used in mining.

